Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 5.4.47-rt28 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 5.4.47 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v5.4-rt
  Head SHA1: 7d6261d9584acb564072ce414f17a6b571a4111a


Or to build 5.4.47-rt28 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v5.x/linux-5.4.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v5.x/patch-5.4.47.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/5.4/patch-5.4.47-rt28.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve

